### MAPs API Tests — PravahOS
### Requires: login first (admin/compliance officer) + generated MAPs

# -------------------------------------------------------
# 1. LIST MAPs
# -------------------------------------------------------

### List all MAPs
GET http://localhost:8000/maps/

### List MAPs filtered by regulation
GET http://localhost:8000/maps/?regulation_id={{regulation_id}}

### List MAPs with nonexistent regulation (expect empty)
GET http://localhost:8000/maps/?regulation_id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


# -------------------------------------------------------
# 2. GET MAP BY ID
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Get single MAP
GET http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}

### Get nonexistent MAP (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8000/maps/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


# -------------------------------------------------------
# 3. REVIEW MAP — approve / edit / reject
#     Requires: compliance_officer or admin role
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Approve a MAP (admin or compliance_officer)
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve"
}

### Reject a MAP
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "reject"
}

### Edit a MAP description + deadline
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "edit",
  "description": "Updated: Banks must implement MFA within 60 days",
  "deadline": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Review MAP with department_manager role (expect 403)
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve"
}

### Review with invalid action (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "delete"
}


# -------------------------------------------------------
# 4. COMPLETE MAP — upload evidence
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Complete a MAP with evidence file
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}/complete
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="mfa_evidence.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

evidence content here
------boundary--

### Complete with unsupported file type (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8000/maps/{{map_id}}/complete
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hack.exe"
Content-Type: application/x-msdownload

malicious content
------boundary--
